"ml.statement": {
"en": "Most skincare sells the morning: glow, protection, a fresh start. Miralune sells the ten minutes before sleep, when the phone is face down and nobody is watching.",
"zh": "大多数护肤品卖的是早晨：光泽、防护、新的一天。Miralune 卖的是睡前十分钟，手机已经扣在桌上，没有人在看你。"
},
"ml.brief": {
"en": "A small label with four products and one evening ritual: cleanse, tone, renew, seal. It has to look calm on a shelf, read clearly on a small label in a dim bathroom, and feel like a gift when the box is opened on camera.",
"zh": "一个小品牌，四款产品，一套晚间仪式：洁面、爽肤、修护、锁水。放在货架上要安静，在昏暗的浴室里小标签也要看得清，镜头前开箱时要像收到礼物。"
},
